STEP D2 — DEFINE CANONICAL ARTICLE LIFECYCLE
==================================================

Reuse existing approved architecture wherever possible.

Establish or normalize a clear lifecycle such as:

DRAFT
   ↓
SUBMITTED / IN REVIEW
   ↓
APPROVED
   ↓
PUBLISHED

