REJECTED / CHANGES REQUESTED

and

ARCHIVED

Do NOT invent unnecessary statuses if equivalent repository-defined states already exist.

Document the allowed transitions.

Prevent invalid transitions.

Examples:

A draft should not accidentally become published through a direct client request.

Archived content should not behave as active published content.

